		{
			description: [
				"*Almar Fuadde* 嘘！安静点！我们在捕猎兔——等等，这些不是兔子！不过说真的，这些家伙不好对付，尤其是当一大群追着你跑的时候。Leechlets 跑得很快，在水里的速度也一样。我强烈建议你在对付它们时要小心。不过好消息是，它们是制作你特殊美食的关键……"
				"{entity:koifees_mobs:leechlet ent_size:0.75 off_x:0.0 off_y:0.0 rot:0.0 spin:USE_GLOBAL idle:USE_GLOBAL walk:USE_GLOBAL width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				"&l(地点：靠近水域)&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "50D93C248EB7B3A1"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "koifees_mobs:leechlet"
				entity_use_tag: false
				entity_vis_idle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_offset_x: 0.0f
				entity_vis_offset_y: 0.0f
				entity_vis_rotation: 0.0f
				entity_vis_silhouette_mode: "NONE"
				entity_vis_size: 1.0f
				entity_vis_spin_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_tag_cycle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_tag_cycle_seconds: 0.0f
				entity_vis_use_as_quest_icon: false
				entity_vis_walk_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				icon: "koifees_mobs:raw_leechmeat"
				id: "233645E19F6947A1"
				type: "kill"
				value: 12L
			}]
			title: "快速、邪恶、吸盘小水母"
			x: -35.0d
			y: 18.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"我很久以前听到一些事，感觉怪怪的……什么和cobble有关，结尾还有“mon”？不太确定和这事有啥关系。总之，Screechbeast大概是大家最喜欢的坐骑。但那得先驯服一只才行……这玩意儿挺难对付的，尤其是它那刺耳的爆破攻击。而且它们飞得老高，用投射武器对付它们会更适合。如果能用某种特殊的诱饵把它引过来，或许你就能驯服一只了……"
				"{entity:koifees_mobs:screechbeast ent_size:0.5 off_x:0.0 off_y:-0.2 rot:0.0 spin:USE_GLOBAL idle:USE_GLOBAL walk:USE_GLOBAL width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				"&l(地点：仅在满月期间生成)&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "714DAD300CB9F252"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "koifees_mobs:screechbeast"
				entity_use_tag: false
				entity_vis_idle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_offset_x: 0.0f
				entity_vis_offset_y: 0.0f
